meta {
  name: Check If In My List
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/my-list/check?tmdbId={{tmdbId}}&mediaType=movie
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  tmdbId: {{tmdbId}}
  mediaType: movie
}

docs {
  # Check If In My List

  Checks whether a specific title (`tmdbId` and `mediaType`) is currently saved in the authenticated user's list (`GET /api/my-list/check`).
  Requires authentication (`authMiddleware`).

  ## Query Parameters
  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `tmdbId` | `number` | Yes | Numeric TMDB identifier. |
  | `mediaType` | `"movie" \| "tv"` | Yes | Content media type. |

  ## Responses
  - **200 OK**: `{ "inList": true }` or `{ "inList": false }`.
  - **400 Bad Request**: `{ "error": "tmdbId and mediaType are required" }`.
  - **401 Unauthorized**: `{ "error": "Unauthorized" }`.
  - **500 Internal Server Error**: `{ "error": "<message>" }`.
}

